OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVery strong winds, peaking in
OL,6,Fthe morning but lasting throughout the
OL,7,Fday, which may be disruptive in the
OL,8,Fnorth. Mostly cloudy with some bright
OL,9,For sunny spells, but feeling cold in
OL,10,Fthe wind. Scattered showers, mainly in
OL,11,Fthe northwest.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FFeeling cold as strong winds
OL,14,Fand showers persist this evening.
OL,15,FThese will ease through the night and
OL,16,Fit will feel chilly under clear spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
