OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FFeeling unpleasant in the
OL,6,Fmorning with strengthening winds under
OL,7,Fa band of rain. Patchy rain and
OL,8,Fbrighter spells for the afternoon, but
OL,9,Fvery strong winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,12,FTuesday will bring strong winds and
OL,13,Fscattered showers, with these easing
OL,14,Finto Wednesday for a bright and breezy
OL,15,Fday. Fine on Thursday with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
